  "description": ".NET MAUI Shell navigation for MVVM apps. Navigate by page type, pass objects to the next page, and return results to the previous one without string routes, QueryProperty, or IQueryAttributable. Pages and popups are bound to ViewModels automatically, ViewModels are resolved through dependency injection, and appearing, disappearing, and navigation data callbacks run in the ViewModel. Supports pushes, modals, tabs, flyout items, and CommunityToolkit popups.",
  "id": "ShellInject",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-11T22:21:08.93Z",
  "licenseExpression": "Apache-2.0",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/Apache-2.0",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "CNj/Rckrd6PzPrkwFvjQMFaVs9NUJ0sg0jFNBhLnqjWIzaDA4QrcRFP7GlLa59U3mBy/RO0TJwZDeGtarezh9w==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 196541,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/scryptfyre/ShellInject",
  "published": "2026-09-11T22:18:01.74Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "• Added typed ViewModel data hooks and parameter-first generic push overloads\n            • Added explicit ViewModel registrations and cached convention discovery\n            • Added optional error reporting for recovered binding and lifecycle failures\n            • Added typed selection for materialized tabs while preserving index-based navigation\n            • Isolated popup tracking by Shell and preserved data across delayed lifecycle callbacks\n            • Prefer exact page types for data delivery while retaining legacy name fallback\n            • Added OnDisappearing alias without removing or obsoleting existing overrides\n            • Preserved existing method signatures, extension wrappers, and public validation exception types\n            • Validate package API compatibility against 10.0.3 and update SourceLink build tooling",
